@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Upload Image dan Segmentasi PIXEL-T

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    ActorBorderColor black
    LifeLineColor black
    BoxBorderColor black
    BoxBgColor white
}

actor "Pengguna" as U
participant "Frontend\n(NewAnalysis.tsx / AnalysisResult.tsx)" as FE
participant "Backend\n(Flask API)" as BE
participant "Pipeline AI\n(U-Net + ResNet50,\nGrad-CAM)" as AI
participant "Supabase\n(Auth + Database + Storage)" as SB

U -> FE: Pilih citra

alt [validasi_gagal]
    FE --> U: Tampilkan pesan validasi sesuai kasus
else [validasi_sukses]
end

note over FE,U
Contoh pesan UI:
Select a JPG, JPEG, or PNG image.
File size exceeds the 10 MB limit.
end note

U -> FE: Klik "Start analysis"
FE -> BE: POST /api/analysis\n(multipart image + Authorization)

alt [validasi_backend_gagal]
    BE --> FE: HTTP 400 dengan pesan validasi API
    FE --> U: Tampilkan pesan dari API
else [validasi_backend_sukses]
end

note over BE,SB
Citra asli diunggah ke Storage terlebih dahulu,
lalu record status processing dibuat di Database.
end note
BE -> SB: Storage: unggah citra asli;\nDatabase: buat record processing
BE -> BE: Antrekan pekerjaan analisis

alt [queue_penuh]
    BE -> SB: Database: hapus record analisis
    BE -> SB: Storage: hapus citra asli
    BE --> FE: HTTP 429 QUEUE_FULL
    FE --> U: The analysis queue is full. Please try again in a moment.
else [queue_tidak_penuh]
end

par Respons HTTP dan pemantauan frontend
    BE --> FE: HTTP 202 Accepted\n(analysis_id, status=processing)

    loop Polling awal dan tiap 2 detik selama processing
        FE -> BE: GET /api/analysis/{id}\n(Authorization)
        BE -> SB: Baca status/progres;\nbuat signed URL citra asli
        BE --> FE: HTTP 200: status dan progres
    end
else Pemrosesan worker di background
    BE ->> AI: Jalankan pipeline analisis

    note over AI
    Decode RGB, preprocessing 512x512,
    inferensi U-Net + ResNet50, post-processing,
    metrik area, Grad-CAM, dan ringkasan template.
    end note

    loop Callback fase dan progres yang dilaporkan
        BE -> SB: Database: simpan progres dari callback pipeline
    end

    alt Pipeline dan penyimpanan berhasil
        AI --> BE: PipelineResult\n(mask, overlay, metrik, Grad-CAM, ringkasan)
        BE -> SB: Storage: unggah mask, overlay,\nheatmap dan overlay Grad-CAM
        BE -> SB: Database: simpan metadata;\nstatus completed
    else Pipeline atau penyimpanan gagal
        BE -> SB: Storage: bersihkan hasil parsial;\nDatabase: simpan status failed dan error
    end
end

FE -> BE: GET /api/analysis/{id}\n(detail halaman hasil)
BE -> SB: Ambil record dan signed URL aset
BE --> FE: Detail, metrik, aset, ringkasan,\nstatus dan error

alt Status completed
    FE --> U: Tampilkan citra, mask, overlay,\nGrad-CAM, metrik dan ringkasan
else Status failed
    FE --> U: Analysis could not be completed. Please try again.
end

note over FE,SB
Frontend memperoleh sesi melalui Supabase Auth.
require_auth memvalidasi setiap request terlindungi.
end note

@enduml